# VendorUpdate.sortspec — Sort specification for VendorUpdate files
#
# VendorUpdate records detected SAL attribute and instTypeID changes.
# Sorted by instID ascending, then instEffectDate ascending.
# This order enables the streaming two-pointer walk in arrangementReclass.scala (Step 9)
# that generates reclass SJEs for RECLASS-type changes.
#
# field_name,       col_index, type, order
instID,             0,         CH,   A
instEffectDate,     2,         CH,   A
